are allies, standing together at the center of a large\ncircle of enemy SOLDIERS.\n\nKeep this situation throughout the opening.\n\n\n=== TECHNICAL ===\n\n16:9 cinematic live-action dark fantasy.\n\nLate sunset.\n\nGrounded realistic action.\n\nNatural English dialogue.\n\nSimple camera movement.\n\nNo subtitles.\n\nNo background music.\n\n\n=== SCENE ===\n\nBegin with a SOLDIER passing close across the foreground.\n\nAs he clears the frame, reveal Riven and Ally much closer.\n\nRiven and Ally are standing back-to-back at the CENTER\nof the surrounding army.\n\nA large circle of SOLDIERS surrounds BOTH of them.\n\nRiven and Ally are allies.\n\nThey fight the surrounding SOLDIERS together.\n\nThey never fight each other.\n\n\nRiven blocks a SOLDIER attacking from her side.\n\nAlly blocks another SOLDIER attacking from the opposite side.\n\nThey stay close together and hold their position.\n\n\nThen show one archer at the side of the surrounding army.\n\nThe archer aims at Riven.\n\nHe fires one arrow.\n\n\nThe arrow flies sideways across the battlefield toward Riven.\n\nRiven is looking in another direction and does not see it.\n\n\nAlly sees the arrow.\n\nHe shouts:\n\n\"RIVEN!\"\n\n\nAlly immediately throws himself in front of Riven.\n\n\nThe arrow hits Ally instead.\n\n\nONLY ALLY is hit.\n\nONLY ALLY falls.\n\nRiven catches Ally as he collapses.\n\nAll other SOLDIERS remain standing in the background.\n\n\nStay close on Riven holding Ally.\n\nRiven asks:\n\n\"Why?\"\n\n\nAlly weakly answers:\n\n\"You would've done the same.\"\n\n\nAlly dies in Riven's arms.\n\n\nRiven slowly looks into the distance.\n\nFar across the valley,\ndark smoke and orange fire rise from her home village.\n\n\nRiven looks at the burning village.\n\nThen she looks back down at Ally.\n\n\nRiven slowly lowers Ally onto the ground.\n\nCUT.、16:9", "hint": "", "ext": {}}, "suggest_questions": [], "local_message_id": "local_message_id_1508010215800081", "section_id": "38417991385436177", "bot_re